  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Market Cap near $303.35B (+1.8% 30D) means crypto dollar liquidity did not re-price hard\u2014incremental demand is coming from product and banking-rail headlines rather than a market-cap surge. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOc3ZNUVJ4TDl0QTdQbFhXODlwSUhyd1BTaHNFNGZoVkppZmMtbDFtSHV0M1FocGczbmZJYk03cXlqeG5ldTBEaF9fOUtkbEd2OUpwZnkxeGotdkIwdGtvVU9pYU9ldS1fQ2h0WTdEanl4M1JiWm1Jc1Z0U3pUcXkxMEVtYkM3bHd1aGhpOXJLY1BkOE1zNEZkOGJlQzJsTllkNnZlOHdxbFAwNElhak5sN1Vnb0g?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LatAm telco VIVA taps Avalanche-based Iris for stablecoin settlement and dollar reserves</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/resources/what-is-arc-the-stablecoin-blockchain-from-usdc-issuer-circle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">What Is Arc? The Stablecoin Blockchain From USDC Issuer Circle</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisdomtree-moonpay-team-up-to-expand-us-access-to-tokenized-money-market-fund?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WisdomTree, MoonPay team up to expand US access to tokenized money market fund</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
